<title>BRAZIL: Brazil Dec 21-Jan 10 IGP-M index rises 1.78 pct.</title>
<headline>Brazil Dec 21-Jan 10 IGP-M index rises 1.78 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian inflation between Dec 21 and Jan 10 rose to 1.78 percent, against 0.30 percent between Nov 21 and Dec 10 as measured by the IGP-M index released by the Getulio Vargas Foundation (FGV).</p>
</text>
